OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAnother cold feeling day, with
OL,6,Fa strengthening breeze later. Dry,
OL,7,Fhowever, with some cloud early in the
OL,8,Fmorning but plenty of sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIncreasingly cloudy with a
OL,12,Ffresh breeze through the evening.
OL,13,FFeeling cold, with a few clear
OL,14,Fintervals before hill fog develops
OL,15,Fover high ground. Frosty.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA dry and frosty start with
OL,18,Fearly hill fog over high ground. Cloud
OL,19,Fwill thicken through the morning,
OL,20,Fbringing outbreaks of rain spreading
OL,21,Feastward, with a gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
